  "description": "The server half of Rask.Cqrs remote dispatch. `MapRaskCqrs()` maps one GET and one POST endpoint that resolve a message by name against the generated allow-list, authorize it, and dispatch it to its ordinary handler — no controllers, no DTO plumbing, no per-message routes. Queries answer JSON or a streamed file; commands accept JSON or multipart uploads; a subscription is served as server-sent events, admitted by the event's watch policy.",
